      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 4.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "hi doctor am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.71,
      "end_seconds": 13.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "come in please sit how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.08,
      "end_seconds": 19.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "I'm here because of a severe headache for days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.69,
      "end_seconds": 23.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.19,
      "end_seconds": 33.25,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "I'm not sure when it began to be honest some weeks ago but I can't say how many"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.83,
      "end_seconds": 43.73,
      "duration_seconds": 9.9,
      "text": "tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.84,
      "end_seconds": 50.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "honestly, a few times a day mostly moderate oh, and double vision"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.6,
      "end_seconds": 54.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.48,
      "end_seconds": 57.43,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "mostly moderate"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.32,
      "end_seconds": 64.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "and what about weakness on one side fever or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.06,
      "end_seconds": 67.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.18,
      "end_seconds": 71.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.36,
      "end_seconds": 76.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "sorry what was I saying no all normal there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.34,
      "end_seconds": 83.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.43,
      "end_seconds": 87.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.21,
      "end_seconds": 90.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.02,
      "end_seconds": 96.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.51,
      "end_seconds": 101.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.88,
      "end_seconds": 105.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.82,
      "end_seconds": 111.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "alright do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.15,
      "end_seconds": 119.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "I've had anxiety yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.1,
      "end_seconds": 133.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.53,
      "end_seconds": 140.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "I'm on escitalopram 10 milligrams maybe once a day for the anxiety"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.69,
      "end_seconds": 146.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Is the the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.23,
      "end_seconds": 153.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. The contraceptive pill, daily."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.86,
      "end_seconds": 157.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.66,
      "end_seconds": 162.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "no I'm not allergic to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.63,
      "end_seconds": 184.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.26,
      "end_seconds": 198.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.98,
      "end_seconds": 224.57,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "okay: pressure 147 over 92, pulse is 86 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 97 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.3,
      "end_seconds": 232.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.76,
      "end_seconds": 237.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.16,
      "end_seconds": 240.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "take a deep breath for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.67,
      "end_seconds": 257.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "The optic discs look swollen and you are drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.44,
      "end_seconds": 271.46,
      "duration_seconds": 10.02,
      "text": "thank you you can get dressed so based on the history and the examination this looks most like possible cerebral venous thrombosis"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.35,
      "end_seconds": 310.79,
      "duration_seconds": 22.44,
      "text": "Stop the pill, you need an urgent scan and admission. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.86,
      "end_seconds": 316.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "mm, I think I understand everything thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.19,
      "end_seconds": 318.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
